assets:[
{n:"US Stocks",s:"MILDLY BULLISH",l:["S&P ~7,723 <span class=up>+0.60%</span> (Tue close), a second straight gain as chip stocks rallied again on the AI trade","Dow ~52,378 <span class=up>+0.03%</span>, held back as energy shares fell with oil","Nasdaq ~26,478 <span class=up>+1.18%</span>; the Philadelphia chip index jumped 3.6% and the Nasdaq 100 had its best day in more than a month (Bloomberg)","Breadth still weak: 41 NYSE new highs vs 108 new lows (WSJ Markets Diary), though advancers beat decliners about 1.8 to 1 (Reuters)","AI money keeps flowing: Meta's $25B share sale was five times oversubscribed and Oracle expanded its OpenAI partnership; Microsoft and Alphabet report after Wednesday's close, Amazon Thursday"]},
{n:"Bonds",s:"NEUTRAL",l:["10Y ~4.99% (Tue close, +0.4bp); 2Y ~4.74%, both up three days in a row; a 5-year auction went well (WSJ)","Fed odds 27 Oct: about 93% hold Wednesday (CME FedWatch via CNBC); better than 80% chance of a hike in December","Evercore ISI expects a Fed that hikes about once a quarter if inflation keeps disappointing; Chair Warsh avoids signaling moves ahead","Data beat: Sep durable goods orders rose more than expected and Oct consumer confidence topped forecasts; Sep PCE and Q3 GDP Thursday"]},
{n:"Oil",s:"NEUTRAL",l:["WTI ~$99.9 <span class=dn>−1.8%</span> (Tue settle $99.90), back under $100 for the first time in days","Brent ~$113.9 <span class=dn>−1.7%</span> (Tue settle $113.88), still near a six-month high; it hit $116.95 intraday after the Houthis claimed a missile hit Saudi Arabia's Ras Tanura refinery","US diesel ~$6.35/gal (AAA, 27 Oct), flat on the day and just under the 22 Sep record ($6.53)","Iran, Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Pakistan agreed to keep talking; Iran's Supreme Leader said the state of 'neither war nor peace' needs to end","UBS now expects Brent near $110 through year-end (up from $100); Gulf crude exports are about 65% of pre-war levels (DTN); OPEC+ meets Sunday"]},
{n:"Gold",s:"NEUTRAL",l:["~$4,067 spot early Wednesday; Comex settled +0.91% at $4,058.80 Tuesday, its second gain in a row","Lower oil eased inflation fears, but a December Fed hike (priced above 80%) caps the upside"]},
{n:"Bitcoin",s:"NEUTRAL",l:["~$80,744 <span class=up>+0.8%</span> (24h, CoinGecko 28 Oct)","Support ~$78k; it dipped under $80,000 Tuesday as the Fed meeting began, then edged back above it as the Nasdaq rallied (CoinDesk)"]}],
sections:[
["Macro",["Sep CPI 3.7% YoY, core 2.6%","PPI +6.3% YoY, biggest since 2022","Fed funds 3.75-4.00%; decision Wed 28 Oct, 2pm ET (Thu 1am Bangkok)","Hike odds: under 10% for 28 Oct (about 93% hold); better than 80% for a hike in December","This week's data: Sep durable goods and Oct consumer confidence beat forecasts (Tue); Sep PCE and Q3 GDP Thursday"]],
["War & Geopolitics",["Iran: Supreme Leader Mojtaba Khamenei met his security chief on conditions for ending the war and said 'neither war nor peace' must end, while stressing control of the Strait of Hormuz","Iran, Saudi Arabia, Turkey and Pakistan agreed to keep talking; Trump is still weighing a deal or more strikes and has said none before the 3 Nov midterms","Houthis claimed a ballistic missile hit Saudi Arabia's Ras Tanura refinery; Saudi Arabia said it intercepted five missiles, two over Riyadh, and has not confirmed a hit","Putin hosted Iran's president in Moscow and said Bushehr nuclear plant construction continues","Russia-Ukraine: the Oleshky local truce is holding and was extended across the Kherson region (BBC); Lavrov says the war is likely to continue and escalate","Israel's election: exit polls show no clear winner; final results expected around 29 Oct"]],
["Trending in Money",["Meta's $25B share sale ended five times oversubscribed (Bloomberg), part of its plan to raise up to $95B for AI","SK Hynix Q3 operating profit hit 83.3 trillion won, beating estimates, with about $75B in shareholder returns planned for 2026","Oracle expanded its OpenAI partnership to put ChatGPT and Codex into Oracle apps and cloud","Banks plan up to ~$21B of high-grade bonds early next year for the $63B Broadcom-Anthropic chip financing (Bloomberg)","India's record $3.1B Jio Platforms IPO debuts 28 Oct after strong demand"]],
["Watch This Week",["Wed 28 Oct: BoT decision (afternoon Bangkok); Microsoft and Alphabet report after the US close; Fed decides 2pm ET (Thu 1am Bangkok), with Warsh's press conference after","Thu 29 Oct: Amazon and Intel report; ECB decides; US Sep PCE and Q3 GDP; BOJ 29-30 Oct; Israel final election results","Fri 30 Oct: Exxon and Chevron report","Sun 1 Nov: OPEC+ meeting, December targets seen steady","US midterms 3 Nov, the date reported Iran strike plans are tied to; Kimi K3.1 Pro open weights due 4 Nov"]],
["Actionable",["Two up days came from AI hopes and cheaper oil, but one Iran or Houthi headline can still swing Brent by $3","Don't buy the dip all at once: wait for Microsoft and Alphabet tonight and Amazon Thursday","Fear (33.6) is easing, but news risk is high and new lows still beat new highs","Watch $78k on BTC, 5% on the 10Y, $4,000 on gold, $100 on WTI and $110-117 on Brent"]]],
